# Directory for Feature-Sliced modules (e.g. pumps, tanks, shifts, transactions)
# Each feature follows:
# features/<feature-name>/
#   ├── api/          (1 file = 1 endpoint: schema, queryKey, fetcher, hook)
#   ├── components/   (tables, dialogs, drawers, cards)
#   └── types/        (types, enums)
